    {
      "gameKey": "BaseParam#44.2",
      "en": "Affects the amount of damage dealt by both physical and magic attacks, as well as the amount of HP restored by healing spells.",
      "hash": "E7BEB75A6AA5924D",
      "unresolved": false,
      "fr": "Influence les dégâts infligés par les attaques physiques et magiques ainsi que le montant de PV restaurés par les sorts curatifs.",
      "ja": "物理・魔法攻撃により与えるダメージ量と回復量に影響を与えます。\r\n意思力が高いほどダメージ量と回復量が増加します。",
      "jaMacro": "物理・魔法攻撃により与えるダメージ量と回復量に影響を与えます。<br>意思力が高いほどダメージ量と回復量が増加します。",
      "conversation": "BaseParam#44",
      "seq": 2,
      "speakerKind": "unknown",
      "kind": "ambient",
      "sheet": "BaseParam"
    },
    {
      "gameKey": "BaseParam#45.1",
